IN THE SCHOOLYARD IN AUGUST

02:54.784 --> 02:59.492
Ta-daa! This is Koto's private room,
now revealed to you, the public!

03:00.117 --> 03:03.992
It's been two months, and my
shooting is coming along nicely.

03:04.659 --> 03:07.451
As for my relationship with Yagami...

03:07.451 --> 03:09.617
Natsumi
Yagami

03:08.159 --> 03:09.617
Not so much.

03:10.409 --> 03:15.617
Yeah... There's still a great distance between us.

03:19.159 --> 03:21.909
It's because you have such
tight security, Natsumi.

03:21.909 --> 03:23.534
Guys can't get near you.

03:23.742 --> 03:25.659
What about you, Matsuri?

03:26.784 --> 03:28.576
Taken.

03:28.576 --> 03:31.117
The guy's crazy about me.

03:33.659 --> 03:35.201
Hey there, Princess.

03:35.742 --> 03:36.992
Nobunaga!

03:37.492 --> 03:39.992
You're Yagami, right?

03:39.992 --> 03:41.867
The star of Cos-Prayers?

03:42.534 --> 03:43.909
Y-yeah.

03:46.201 --> 03:49.201
I think you and I will be meeting again soon.

03:49.201 --> 03:51.159
H-hey!

03:51.159 --> 03:55.492
Silly girl. I was just being nice, Princess.

04:11.242 --> 04:12.659
We're running away?!

04:12.659 --> 04:14.826
Be ready to go, soon!

04:15.492 --> 04:18.201
We're abandoning everyone and running away?!

04:18.201 --> 04:20.034
Right now, instead of saving everyone,

04:20.034 --> 04:23.576
we have to concentrate
on destroying the dark tower!

04:24.117 --> 04:25.242
CUT!

04:25.909 --> 04:28.367
Sorry, was that no good?

04:28.367 --> 04:30.701
I know that wasn't how we set it up,

04:30.701 --> 04:33.409
but I thought running out into
the rain would be good enough.

04:33.659 --> 04:36.951
No, no, I like it. Your spirit sells it.

04:36.951 --> 04:40.117
Hey! We're gonna focus on Scarlet in this scene!

04:40.117 --> 04:43.034
Reset the camera and give me
a zoom up on Youko!

04:43.534 --> 04:46.909
What? I thought Yagami was really good.

04:47.492 --> 04:50.201
Oh, look at that face she's making...

04:50.201 --> 04:51.867
Yagami can handle this!

04:54.534 --> 04:56.992
One by one, Sister-Rayer
and the other captives...

04:56.992 --> 05:00.742
are ruthlessly brainwashed
by the enemy commanders.

05:00.742 --> 05:04.242
In the end, Miko-Rayer writhes
in unimaginable torment.

05:04.242 --> 05:06.617
This is the climax of episode 10, huh?

05:07.284 --> 05:09.951
It's a test of Miko-Rayer's righteous heart.

05:10.701 --> 05:13.076
Just as Yagami's trying hard to improve herself,

05:13.076 --> 05:15.701
I have to keep up with her

05:13.077 --> 05:15.701
and give her a bigger part.

05:15.826 --> 05:19.159
That's all I can do for her for now...

05:19.659 --> 05:22.326
How do we portray unimaginable torment?

05:22.451 --> 05:23.534
Well...

05:24.076 --> 05:27.159
NO!

05:29.451 --> 05:32.909
Are you feeling a bit more
cooperative, little kitten?

05:36.409 --> 05:38.201
You thrill my heart.

05:38.201 --> 05:40.117
Who is the real master here?

05:40.617 --> 05:43.576
I'll carve it into your heart and body for you!

05:45.242 --> 05:48.201
Hold it! That's going way overboard!

05:48.201 --> 05:49.617
Ooizumi?

05:50.326 --> 05:52.326
What do you mean "hold it"?

05:52.326 --> 05:54.076
Um... Nothing.

05:54.076 --> 05:56.034
I'll work on the details tonight.

06:01.117 --> 06:02.284
Yagami!

06:02.909 --> 06:05.909
Ooizumi, I have a favor to ask.

06:05.909 --> 06:07.284
A favor?

06:07.284 --> 06:09.076
I want you to be with me...

06:11.534 --> 06:14.992
From now on, we're boyfriend and girlfriend!

06:15.451 --> 06:17.076
...to rehearse with.

06:18.326 --> 06:20.576
We have school tomorrow.

06:20.576 --> 06:23.867
I'll wait for you in the music room
after homeroom.

06:23.867 --> 06:25.367
R-right...

06:25.367 --> 06:27.909
A promise for just the two of us, okay?

06:31.034 --> 06:34.951
For just the two of us, huh?
That has a nice ring to it.

06:35.409 --> 06:38.742
That smile... I have a feeling
progress is going to be made!

06:38.742 --> 06:40.492
Ooizumi?

06:41.076 --> 06:43.576
I'd like to change clothes, so... Do you mind?

06:43.576 --> 06:46.576
Huh? Oh! Um... Sorry!

06:47.367 --> 06:48.201
Wait!

06:54.492 --> 06:56.992
I won't be long. Can you wait there for me?

06:56.992 --> 07:00.326
But, don't you think this is a bad idea?

07:00.326 --> 07:03.117
I trust you, Ooizumi.

07:03.701 --> 07:07.034
Besides, I wouldn't mind
if someone I liked saw me.

07:08.867 --> 07:10.742
You see, it's...

07:10.742 --> 07:13.909
There's something bothering me
that I really want to talk about.

07:14.409 --> 07:16.617
The show isn't going well.

07:16.617 --> 07:19.492
Huh? Didn't Ohsoji just compliment you?

07:20.034 --> 07:22.951
All he did was appreciate my enthusiasm.

07:22.951 --> 07:26.242
I thought I'd push myself by doing stuff...

07:26.242 --> 07:29.534
with longer dialogue and no stunt men, but...

07:30.242 --> 07:33.034
I suppose it's because Yagami is the star.

07:36.117 --> 07:36.826
Katsuragi!

07:37.034 --> 07:38.742
NO!

07:43.034 --> 07:47.076
Something moved! It was little and black,
like a cockroach!

07:48.617 --> 07:50.742
We have entered the New Experience Zone!

07:50.742 --> 07:52.242
Exactly!

07:52.701 --> 07:56.617
I told them I have a fear of heights,
so I hate airplanes,

07:56.617 --> 08:00.076
but they signed me to do
a photo shoot overseas!

08:00.409 --> 08:02.159
Excuse us!

08:02.159 --> 08:03.159
Huh?

08:03.159 --> 08:07.534
Didn't Katsuragi say she was
changing in here, Yazawa?

08:07.534 --> 08:09.201
Yeah.

08:13.701 --> 08:16.284
Wh-wh-what do we do?

08:18.909 --> 08:21.826
Please don't look at me like that!

08:26.576 --> 08:27.784
Huh?

08:28.492 --> 08:30.742
My base suit isn't here.

08:30.742 --> 08:32.701
Didn't you take it out before?

08:34.492 --> 08:36.784
Maybe it fell back here.

08:40.201 --> 08:41.742
Find it?

08:42.659 --> 08:43.701
Um...

08:45.451 --> 08:48.242
Oh, there it is.

08:48.534 --> 08:51.034
Yay! Thank you!

08:56.992 --> 09:00.492
If I know Imamura, she's telling
everyone right now!

09:01.076 --> 09:04.992
I had no idea you were so shameless!

09:04.992 --> 09:06.992
I'm shocked, too.

09:06.992 --> 09:11.034
I'll bet you want your making-of video
to be us in just our underwear!

09:11.034 --> 09:13.951
I've never even let my parents see me like that!

09:14.242 --> 09:17.117
It... It's not true! It's a misunderstanding!

09:17.117 --> 09:20.409
There were reasons! An accident I got caught in!

09:20.409 --> 09:21.701
You mean it's my fault?

09:22.659 --> 09:24.909
No, that's not what I meant!

09:25.201 --> 09:32.367
It's over! I'm ruined! This will destroy me!

09:32.742 --> 09:35.284
I wish you'd told us before.

09:38.534 --> 09:41.701
It's manly to be a little pervy.

09:45.076 --> 09:48.117
Anyway, everyone prefers to be nude.

09:51.492 --> 09:54.076
I've never done this before. It's so exciting!

09:54.451 --> 09:57.034
What? WHAT?!

09:57.742 --> 09:59.367
Stop that, everyone.

10:00.284 --> 10:03.201
You have to be gentler to a man.

10:03.701 --> 10:05.284
Katsuragi...?

10:06.201 --> 10:08.242
I'll do anything.

10:08.242 --> 10:10.659
Anything you want me to, Ooizumi.

10:10.659 --> 10:12.784
A-a-anything I want?!

10:14.492 --> 10:15.784
And you want all sorts of things.

10:15.992 --> 10:18.951
N-no, I just...

10:18.951 --> 10:21.492
Don't be shy. Come on.

10:21.492 --> 10:23.284
Get it up.

10:25.242 --> 10:31.409
Get it up! Get it up! Get it up! Get it up!

10:35.242 --> 10:37.284
A... A dream...

10:39.909 --> 10:41.867
We have school tomorrow.

10:41.867 --> 10:45.367
I'll wait for you in the music room
after homeroom.

10:49.617 --> 10:51.492
I slept through it!

10:52.284 --> 10:55.617
But, if Imamura told her what happened, then...!

10:56.034 --> 10:58.784
She probably didn't wait for me at all.

11:04.742 --> 11:06.409
Yagami!

11:08.867 --> 11:12.117
I'm sorry I'm so late.

11:08.868 --> 11:12.117
You still waited for me, though.

11:12.742 --> 11:15.117
I was the one who made
you promise to come here.

11:15.117 --> 11:16.951
I decided I'd wait, no matter how long it took.

11:17.534 --> 11:18.617
Yagami...

11:19.867 --> 11:22.117
I'm sorry. Let's get to it.

11:22.117 --> 11:25.117
What episode is it? Do you have a script?

11:27.492 --> 11:28.492
Yagami?

11:29.326 --> 11:31.909
I lied about rehearsing for the show.

11:33.076 --> 11:36.659
I just wanted to be alone with you.

11:40.409 --> 11:43.242
No matter how hard I try, nothing seems to work.

11:43.742 --> 11:46.534
I just don't know anymore if I can do this.

11:46.534 --> 11:49.451
I have no self-confidence now. So...

11:52.867 --> 11:57.076
Please... Just hold me.

12:06.242 --> 12:09.284
Yagami, you shouldn't just run to me.

12:10.492 --> 12:13.326
I mean, telling me like this is really flattering,

12:13.576 --> 12:15.576
but you have to keep fighting!

12:16.201 --> 12:18.992
It's no time to go looking for comfort.

12:21.367 --> 12:23.701
Shall we rehearse, then?

12:28.826 --> 12:30.992
Okay, then pretend I'm the camera!

12:31.659 --> 12:32.951
Let's do this!

12:33.742 --> 12:36.826
And... Action!

