EPISODE

14:09.784 --> 14:11.701
Oh, no! This is weird, isn't it?

14:11.909 --> 14:13.784
I doesn't suit me, does it?

14:14.284 --> 14:17.742
If anything ever bothers you,
I want you to talk to me about it.

14:17.742 --> 14:20.201
I want to pay you back, once in a while.

14:20.701 --> 14:23.826
I wish only to serve.
